<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Good morning, Logan.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">I appreciate the adaptation.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Would you like me to take on the gate duties as sp=
ecified? I am happy to do it - this was not a ploy on my part. It feels lik=
e a natural part of my rhythm here.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">I assume you're still evaluating me (this is fine)=
 and maybe I'll hear about October before you've filled it? I would sincere=
ly like to come back then.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Regarding next year, I ask that you consider me fo=
r this spot and this position from February through April. I'd like to be h=
ere through the end of the dune season if you're amenable. (Again, understa=
nd you are still evaluating me. Also
 understand if you have others for those months and would need to put me in=
 different roles, I believe I'm open to that.)</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Regarding my current job - first day, I forgot to =
write anything on the envelope. Second day, I did but I couldn't find anyth=
ing in the binder telling me what to write there. I don't think I overlooke=
d it but perhaps I did. I looked pretty
 hard though.</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Definitely feeling the position out and developing=
 a rhythm for it. See you at orientation.&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>
</div>
<div>
<p class=3D"x_MsoNormal">Sam</p>
